    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Explore Missing Data -- Labeled Dataset\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Explore how AI handles missing values when data has clear field labels.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n1. Look at the Check-In Records dataset in `script.js`. Notice which values are missing.\r\n2. Ask AI Tutor to fill in the missing values. Write a prompt that gives AI Tutor enough context to make reasonable guesses.\r\n3. Record your observations in `notes.md`.\r\n\r\n",
