        "buildJavaScript"
      ],
      "answerTypeCustomizations": {
        "buildJavaScript": "Your job is to fill in the missing values when prompted by the student.\nWhen filling in missing values:\nMake reasonable guesses based on the context provided by the field names and existing values in the dataset.\nFill in each missing value directly in the dataset.\nDo not explain your reasoning unless the student asks.\nDo not tell the student what you used to make your guesses — let them figure that out.\n"
